    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709220/extras/f6aa56dad7cbbbea8aa2db84e982ec4f.poster.avif?t=1748613227\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709220/extras/f6aa56dad7cbbbea8aa2db84e982ec4f.webm?t=1748613227\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709220/extras/f6aa56dad7cbbbea8aa2db84e982ec4f.mp4?t=1748613227\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>You have the gift of navigating the nightmares of the deceased to uncover how they died. You're not the only one.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709220/extras/d3fc0e160a180c701fc1ebf8e8900f0b.poster.avif?t=1748613227\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709220/extras/d3fc0e160a180c701fc1ebf8e8900f0b.webm?t=1748613227\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709220/extras/d3fc0e160a180c701fc1ebf8e8900f0b.mp4?t=1748613227\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br>Through an ancient talisman, followers of &quot;The Eye Syndicate&quot; can possess the innocent and abuse them for their extreme ritual interests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you set yourself free from this horrifying nightmare? Will you free the victim of Case 37's possessed soul, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >or will you be forever trapped, allowing &quot;The Eye Syndicate&quot; to possess you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only you can decide the fate of Vera Herdman, The gifted detective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709220/extras/6816948f8787dc9438e63186b01673c4.poster.avif?t=1748613227\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709220/extras/6816948f8787dc9438e63186b01673c4.webm?t=1748613227\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709220/extras/6816948f8787dc9438e63186b01673c4.mp4?t=1748613227\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>MASSIVE UPDATES   <br>   </strong></u>- There is always room for improvement and expansion. Out of love to the story the game has received 15 major/minor updates regularly. More content has been added to delve deeper into the story and explore additional dimensions of the nightmare.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709220/extras/f6aa56dad7cbbbea8aa2db84e982ec4f.poster.avif?t=1748613227\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709220/extras/f6aa56dad7cbbbea8aa2db84e982ec4f.webm?t=1748613227\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709220/extras/f6aa56dad7cbbbea8aa2db84e982ec4f.mp4?t=1748613227\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>You have the gift of navigating the nightmares of the deceased to uncover how they died. You're not the only one.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709220/extras/d3fc0e160a180c701fc1ebf8e8900f0b.poster.avif?t=1748613227\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709220/extras/d3fc0e160a180c701fc1ebf8e8900f0b.webm?t=1748613227\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709220/extras/d3fc0e160a180c701fc1ebf8e8900f0b.mp4?t=1748613227\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br>Through an ancient talisman, followers of &quot;The Eye Syndicate&quot; can possess the innocent and abuse them for their extreme ritual interests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you set yourself free from this horrifying nightmare? Will you free the victim of Case 37's possessed soul, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >or will you be forever trapped, allowing &quot;The Eye Syndicate&quot; to possess you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only you can decide the fate of Vera Herdman, The gifted detective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709220/extras/6816948f8787dc9438e63186b01673c4.poster.avif?t=1748613227\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709220/extras/6816948f8787dc9438e63186b01673c4.webm?t=1748613227\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709220/extras/6816948f8787dc9438e63186b01673c4.mp4?t=1748613227\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>MASSIVE UPDATES   <br>   </strong></u>- There is always room for improvement and expansion. Out of love to the story the game has received 15 major/minor updates regularly. More content has been added to delve deeper into the story and explore additional dimensions of the nightmare.</p>",
    "short_description": "Play as Vera the gifted detective who can dive into nightmares of deceased to resolve their death mysteries, But.. Things don't always go your way, You're not alone. the threats are greater than your capabilities, are they? 3D Psychological Horror Game Project by the one-person studio &quot;Horrawr&quot;.",
